label Greeting
if {Transaction_VisitVar} <= 50:
	LoloPilo: Ho-ho! Just passing by to rest my feet, apo. The breeze near your awning is the best in Karimlan!
	LoloPilo: Back in '68, nobody could beat me in the plaza games. Still got the wrist for it, too!
else:
	LoloPilo: Magandang araw, apo! Just checking if the neighborhood kids still remember how to play outside.
	LoloPilo: Keep the counter lively, ha? I'll hang around by the shade for a bit!
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

label Smalltalk
if {Transaction_VisitVar} <= 50:
	LoloPilo: Hehe! Watching folks come and go here reminds me of the old fiesta days, apo.
	LoloPilo: Alright, my punso's calling me home. Don't forget to stretch your legs too!
else:
	LoloPilo: You know, apo, a good game keeps a tired spirit young—human or duwende alike!
	LoloPilo: I'll be heading off now. Next time I drop by, be ready for a match!
[end_timeline]
